# Local checkouts of other branches: gigabytes, and one may be a private repository.
.worktrees
**/.worktrees

# Keys, certificates and environment files, wherever they are. The image is built from source alone and needs none.
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local caches and editor files.
**/.DS_Store
**/.angular
.swiftpm
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Persistent full-server data must never enter an image.
**/notato-server-data
**/.notato-monitor
